    {
      "id": "scene_03",
      "type": "question",
      "text": "ETF到底是什么呢？全称叫交易型开放式指数基金。听起来很复杂对吧？别急，咱们慢慢拆解。",
      "duration": 7.728,
      "character": {
        "type": "thinking",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "money",
        "path": "assets/icons/金币堆_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
          "name": "risk",
          "path": "assets/icons/风险管理_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "company",
          "path": "assets/icons/办公楼_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "chart",
          "path": "assets/icons/K线图_白板手绘.png"
        }
      ],
      "audio": {
        "path": "audio/scene_03.mp3",
        "duration_ms": 7728,
        "word_timestamps": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_04",
      "type": "analogy",
      "text": "你可以把ETF想象成一个超市购物车。基金经理帮你把各种优质股票都装进这个购物车里，比如沪深300ETF就装了300家最优秀的公司。",
      "duration": 10.344,
      "character": {
        "type": "pointing",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "company",
        "path": "assets/icons/办公楼_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
          "name": "wallet",
          "path": "assets/icons/钱包_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "coin",
          "path": "assets/icons/金币堆_白板手绘.png"
        }
      ],
      "audio": {
        "path": "audio/scene_04.mp3",
        "duration_ms": 10344,
        "word_timestamps": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_05",
      "type": "explain",
      "text": "ETF最大的特点就是追踪指数。比如你买了一份芯片ETF，它就会按照芯片指数的成分股，帮你同比例买入所有芯片龙头股。",
      "duration": 9.528,
      "character": {
        "type": "pointing",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "stock_up",
        "path": "assets/icons/上升趋势箭头_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
          "name": "report",
          "path": "assets/icons/财务报表_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "money",
          "path": "assets/icons/金币堆_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "growth",
          "path": "assets/icons/火箭上升_白板手绘.png"
        }
      ],
      "audio": {
        "path": "audio/scene_05.mp3",
        "duration_ms": 9528,
        "word_timestamps": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_06",
      "type": "example",
      "text": "举个例子，假设芯片指数里包含中芯国际占30%、韦尔股份占20%等等，你买一万块的芯片ETF，就相当于自动帮你分配好了这些股票。",
      "duration": 10.8,
      "character": {
        "type": "neutral",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "chart",
        "path": "assets/icons/K线图_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
          "name": "yuan",
          "path": "assets/icons/人民币符号_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "dollar",
          "path": "assets/icons/美元符号_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "report",
          "path": "assets/icons/财务报表_白板手绘.png"
        }
      ],
      "audio": {
        "path": "audio/scene_06.mp3",
        "duration_ms": 10800,
        "word_timestamps": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_07",
      "type": "comparison",
      "text": "那ETF和普通基金有啥区别呢？最大的不同是交易方式！ETF可以像股票一样，在股市开盘时间随时买卖，价格实时变动。",
      "duration": 9.912,
      "character": {
        "type": "pointing",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "trade",
        "path": "assets/icons/套利_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
          "name": "risk",
          "path": "assets/icons/风险管理_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "growth",
          "path": "assets/icons/火箭上升_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "trend",
          "path": "assets/icons/股票投资_白板手绘.png"
        }
      ],
      "audio": {
        "path": "audio/scene_07.mp3",
        "duration_ms": 9912,
        "word_timestamps": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_08",
      "type": "comparison",
      "text": "而普通基金呢，每天只能按照收盘后的净值申购赎回，要等一两天才能到账。ETF就方便多了，买卖都是秒级成交！",
      "duration": 9.24,
      "character": {
        "type": "happy",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "exchange",
        "path": "assets/icons/纽交所_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
          "name": "risk",
          "path": "assets/icons/风险管理_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "growth",
          "path": "assets/icons/火箭上升_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "trend",
          "path": "assets/icons/股票投资_白板手绘.png"
        }
      ],
      "audio": {
        "path": "audio/scene_08.mp3",
        "duration_ms": 9240,
        "word_timestamps": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_09",
      "type": "explain",
      "text": "而且ETF的费用也更低。管理费通常只有百分之零点五左右，买卖只需要付股票佣金，没有申购赎回费，长期投资能省不少钱！",
      "duration": 9.312,
      "character": {
        "type": "happy",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "yuan",
        "path": "assets/icons/人民币符号_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
          "name": "report",
          "path": "assets/icons/财务报表_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "money",
          "path": "assets/icons/金币堆_白板手绘.png"
        },
        {
          "name": "growth",
          "path": "assets/icons/火箭上升_白板手绘.png"
        }
      ],
      "audio": {
        "path": "audio/scene_09.mp3",
        "duration_ms": 9312,
        "word_timestamps": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_10",
      "type": "example",
      "text": "现在市场上的ETF种类可丰富了！有跟踪大盘的，像沪深300、中证500；有行业主题的，像新能源、医药、白酒；还有跨境的，像纳斯达克、恒生科技。",
      "duration": 12.672,
      "character": {
        "type": "pointing",
        "path": null
      },
      "icon": {
        "name": "stock",
        "path": "assets/icons/股票投资_白板手绘.png"
      },
      "extra_icons": [
        {
